@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5068
@token = replace-with-authenticated-token


Accept: application/json

###

### Active cabin categories in the current office
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/planning/categories?ItemTypeCode=CABIN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a previewed invoice PDF through configured SMTP.
### This sends real mail when SMTP is configured: replace IDs, addresses and the local PDF deliberately.
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/email/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=HyrEmailExample

--HyrEmailExample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="subject"

Faktura 123
--HyrEmailExample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="body"

<p>Hej!</p>
--HyrEmailExample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="receivers"

[{"email":"customer@example.invalid","doSend":true}]
--HyrEmailExample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ccRecipients"

[{"email":"office@example.invalid","doSend":false}]
--HyrEmailExample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="invoiceId"

123
--HyrEmailExample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="invoice_123.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./example.pdf
--HyrEmailExample--

### For a reservation, replace invoiceId with reservationId; do not send both.
### The total multipart request must not exceed 25,000,000 bytes.

### All unreturned customer rentals in the current office, including future bookings
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/planning/customer-rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Active lift categories in the current office
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/planning/categories?ItemTypeCode=LIFT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Category-filtered cabins (legacy CabinTypeCodes may also be supplied)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/planning/cabins?CategoryIds=1&AvailableFrom=2026-11-08T00:00:00&AvailableTo=2026-11-10T23:59:59
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Category-filtered available lifts
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/planning/lifts?CategoryIds=1&AvailableFrom=2026-11-08T00:00:00&AvailableTo=2026-11-10T23:59:59
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lift reservations use the linked item's category
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/planning/reservations?ItemTypeCode=LIFT&CategoryIds=1&From=2026-11-08T00:00:00&To=2026-11-30T23:59:59
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Available articles for category assignment (current office only)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/itemcategory/form-options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read category articles and quantities (use IDs from this office)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/itemcategory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save category article quantities; [] clears them and omission preserves them
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/itemcategory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Kategori",
  "sortOrder": 0,
  "articles": [
    { "articleId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "articleId": 2, "quantity": 1.5 }
  ]
}

### Invalid or other-office article IDs are rejected without saving changes
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/itemcategory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Kategori",
  "articles": [{ "articleId": -1, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Zero and negative article quantities are rejected without saving changes
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/itemcategory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Kategori",
  "articles": [{ "articleId": 1, "quantity": 0 }]
}
